sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Winner (Browser)
  participant FE as Next.js Frontend
  participant API as Express API
  participant ST as Stripe
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  W->>FE: Open /checkout/:auctionId
  FE->>API: POST /api/payments/create-checkout-session
  API->>DB: Validate winner + amount
  alt Stripe configured
    API->>ST: Create Checkout Session
    ST-->>API: session.url
    API->>DB: Store pending Transaction
    API-->>FE: { url, mode: stripe }
    FE->>ST: Redirect to Checkout
    ST-->>W: Pay
    ST-->>API: webhook / session-status paid
    API->>DB: placeInEscrow (held)
  else Dev payments allowed
    API->>DB: placeInEscrow (held, simulated)
    API-->>FE: { mode: dev, success url }
  end
  FE-->>W: Show escrow held status
